      "claim": "Larotaxel, a taxane sharing the same core and C-13 side-chain architecture as the query, is reported to cross the blood-brain barrier and is minimally recognized by P-glycoprotein, providing direct transferable evidence that this taxane class can achieve meaningful CNS access.",
